<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-logo { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .instruction-text { margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold; }
  .form-group input[type="text"] { width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .reference-list { margin-top: 10px; }
  .reference-list p { margin: 5px 0; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="College Logo" style="height: 50px; vertical-align: middle;">
    <span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; float: right;">SMITH COLLEGE</span>
  </div>

  <div style="clear: both;"></div>

  <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 12px;">
    Department of Government<br>
    <span data-field="department_address_line_1">{{ department_address_line_1 }}</span><br>
    <span data-field="department_email">{{ department_email }}</span><br>
    <span data-field="department_phone">{{ department_phone }}</span>
  </div>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 40px;">Jean Picker Semester-in-Washington Program Application</h2>

  <div class="instruction-text">
    Instructions: download and save this document to your local drive. Fill it out, name and save again, and email your completed document as an attachment to <span data-field="application_email">{{ application_email }}</span> with the subject heading: Picker Program Application. All application materials are due no later than Friday, <span data-field="application_deadline_date">{{ application_deadline_date }}</span>.
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Name:</label>
    <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Email address:</label>
    <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Smith ID Number:</label>
    <span data-field="smith_id_number">{{ smith_id_number }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Major:</label>
    <span data-field="major">{{ major }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Home Town:</label>
    <span data-field="home_town">{{ home_town }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>U.S. Representative:</label>
    <span data-field="us_representative">{{ us_representative }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    List two references, at least one of which must be a Smith faculty member. Send each a recommendation form, found on the web page, or the link to the form.
  </div>
  <div class="reference-list">
    <p>1. <span data-field="reference_1_name">{{ reference_1_name }}</span></p>
    <p>2. <span data-field="reference_2_name">{{ reference_2_name }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    Separately, please provide the following information:
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    1. A list of relevant college-level courses, with your grades and the names of your instructors. Include courses you are taking currently or plan to take in the spring, as well as courses in fields other than Government that would help to qualify you for internships. A minimum GPA of 3.0 is required, both overall and within your major (if declared).
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span data-field="course_list_details">{{ course_list_details }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    2. A resume or list of previous work experience
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span data-field="resume_details">{{ resume_details }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    3. Positions in Washington to which you would like to apply if you are accepted into this program. (General policy interest areas can be listed as well.)
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span data-field="position_interests">{{ position_interests }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    4. Unofficial transcript
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span data-field="transcript_status">{{ transcript_status }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">
    5. Essay: write briefly (2 double-spaced pages) indicating how this program fits into your overall academic program. How would it complement what you have already accomplished and serve as preparation for what you plan to do, academically and otherwise, in the future?
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span data-field="essay_content">{{ essay_content }}</span>
  </div>
</div>